  },
  {
   "claim": "Berat 50 kg terasa 5 kg; lompatan 0,5 m jadi 5 m; 6 detik di udara.",
   "working": "Weight scales with g: 50 kg x 0.1 = 5 kg-force. Same take-off speed v = sqrt(2 x 9.81 x 0.5) = 3.13 m/s. Height h = v^2 / (2 x 0.981) = 5.0 m. Air time t = 2v / g = 2 x 3.13 / 0.981 = 6.4 s. A 0.5 m standing jump is a typical adult figure (story assumption, labelled 'lompatan biasa').",
   "source": "projectile motion; h = v^2/2g, t = 2v/g"
  },
